  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-MORT-NPC18_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Good. That means he will be coming down here to punish the Mortal Plain. I wonder why he hasn't already.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Player_BranchBoss_B_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Red_Death_DM-MORT_013.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687178,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-MORT-NPC08_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Something about festivities, right?",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_Miranda_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Miranda_Briar_DM-MORT_087.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687162,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-MORT-NPC18_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Festivities? At a time when Darkmoor's Houses face their greatest danger? Then perhaps we need to increase our threat.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Player_BranchBoss_B_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Red_Death_DM-MORT_014.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687178,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-MORT-NPC18_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "There is a crop that is likely forbidden here, a plant whose simple odor makes the vampire's blood burn. I don't know where to find the seeds, but-",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Player_BranchBoss_B_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Red_Death_DM-MORT_015.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687178,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-MORT-NPC08_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "But maybe that shifty informant friend of yours has an idea?",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_Miranda_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Miranda_Briar_DM-MORT_088.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687162,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Complete",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-CAMP-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "You return! Ha! Splendid. Have you brought me a cure for the Scholomance Curse?",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_OutsiderQueen_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Queen_Glorina_DM-MORT_015.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687136,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-CAMP-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Hmm. This does not sound like a cure for the Scholomance Curse. This sounds like a drawn out tale of betrayal and biting.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_OutsiderQueen_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Queen_Glorina_DM-MORT_016.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687136,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-001_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "You are not seriously trusting Miranda Briar, are you? She killed Sybil and we still don't know why!",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Velma_von_Venkman_DM-MORT_037.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700033,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-001_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Did you try whomping her on the head? Bet that would knock the information out of her.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Velma_von_Venkman_DM-MORT_038.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700033,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-CAMP-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I see your guile at play, Scion. Too aggressive an approach and the Broken Branch may vanish with their cure. You must play Briar's game for now.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_OutsiderQueen_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Queen_Glorina_DM-MORT_017.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687136,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-001_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Look, I'm just saying Briar isn't helping out of the goodness of her rotten heart. She wants something. Watch out for the moment she takes it.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Velma_von_Venkman_DM-MORT_039.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700033,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-CAMP-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Aye. For now, though, talk to Keziah; that old mystic should have some Garlic Seeds hidden in her apothecary.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_OutsiderQueen_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Queen_Glorina_DM-MORT_018.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687136,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-CAMP-NPC01B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Oh, the King of Cups stands opposite Death Reversed. And the Magician returns, seeking seeds. Here they are.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Scholomari_FortuneF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Keziah_DM-MORT_032.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1675588,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-CAMP-NPC01B_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Beware the Thorned Hermit. She has her own use for seeds and they plant only destruction.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Scholomari_FortuneF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Keziah_DM-MORT_033.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1675588,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-MORT-NPC03_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Garlic! Stranger, that is the forbidden crop!",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Human_Outsider_B_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Edward_Farmer_DM-MORT_005.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687159,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      }
